  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Updates:\n• This release now fully supports .Net 9.0.\n\nFixes:\n• Bunifu Label: Fixed flickering issue in Table Layout Panels.\n\nMigration Notes:\nFrom version 6.0.0 and above, we have revamped our licensing architecture from the old .Net Framework standard. Therefore, if you happen to receive errors relating to the \"Licenses.licx\" file, please go ahead and delete the file then clean and rebuild your project. For more info, please visit https://docs2.bunifuframework.com/docs/getting-started/installation-net5plus\n\nIf you're upgrading from a project using the deprecated version 1.5.3, please install 'Bunifu.UI.WinForms.1.5.3' (version 2.0.0) via NuGet for backward compatibility with newer releases of Bunifu.UI.WinForms. Also, if you're building a VB.NET project and after installation receive ambiguous namespace errors (e.g. BunifuTextBox has an ambiguous namespace...), please install 'Bunifu.UI.WinForms.Deprecated' (version 2.0.0) via NuGet then rebuild your project. In case of any further upgrade issues, feel free to contact us via our bottom-right chat section at https://bunifuframework.com/.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
